# Docker 构建上下文裁剪(仓库根目录是 web/后端镜像的构建上下文)
#
# 不裁的话 flutter/ 会把整个 Flutter SDK(数 GB)发给 Docker daemon,
# 在 2C2G 服务器上直接拖垮构建。
.git
.github
.claude
.remember
.superpowers
.vscode
.playwright-mcp

# 与镜像无关的大目录
flutter
app
docs
tools
imserver

# Python 运行产物
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
chatapp/.env
chatapp/.env.*
chatapp/media
chatapp/staticfiles
chatapp/logs

# 前端依赖与产物(镜像内重新 npm ci / npm run build)
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
web/coverage
